id=enable_live_blur
name=Samsung Native Live Blur
version=1.6.6
versionCode=19
author=Local
description=AOD clock glass-state correction, bounded UI frame pacing and AOD transition refresh boost, fullscreen AOD wallpaper, AOD-to-lockscreen clock transition, per-app configurable Samsung native JNI blur support and original SM-S942B color-curve renderer for this SM-A576B build. Refreshes stale renderer mounts after updates; pins GLES with first-failure recovery. Zygisk Next and reboot required.
